B.cN6=new A.A("Only new users (\u201cNew Users\u201d) who have a valid NUEIN User Account and log in through the NUEIN App are eligible to participate in the Super Start Promotion (the \u201cPromotion\u201d or the \u201cSuper Start Promotion\u201d). A New User is a user who has not placed an order on the NUEIN Site or App in the past 365 days. You must be logged into your NUEIN User Account on the NUEIN App to be able to participate in the Promotion. If you have not yet downloaded the NUEIN App or created a NUEIN User Account, you may download the App for free and create a free NUEIN User Account.",null,B.adH,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
