B.cQj=new A.A("1. After logging onto your NUEIN User Account on the NUEIN App, you may access the Promotion through a Promotion pop-up window directing you to the spinning wheel. Each New User gets 3 spins.\n2. Every spin is guaranteed to win a coupon pack. Coupons are added to your account automatically and are shown in Me > Coupons.\n3. Coupons are valid for 7 days, can be used on orders shipped within Algeria, and cannot be exchanged for cash.\n4. NUEIN may end or modify the Promotion at any time.",null,B.adH,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null)
